                        </div>
                        <div class="p-2 rounded-xl bg-teal-50/80 dark:bg-teal-950/40 border border-teal-200/70 dark:border-teal-800/60 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200">
                            <span class="font-bold text-teal-700 dark:text-teal-300">Nhóm 6 (13 SV):</span> TH Hóa <strong>Chiều T3 (C606)</strong> • TH Giải phẫu <strong>Chiều T4 (C402)</strong>
